	<meta property="og:description" content="UPDATE September 2026: Students, you can continue to use your student passes for the Fall 2026 school year! Students MUST show school ID to board. &nbsp; Golden Empire Transit District received a grant to provide FREE bus rides to all students Kindergarten through College including vocational and private schools in the Bakersfield Metro area. Students [&hellip;]" />
